# ::tok This closes some ANSICc-incompatible feature keywords in GNUCc, as well as ANSItrigraph features such as unix and vax that indicate that they are welcome and rarely used, and disables all standard libraries that are available in the host environment ( hosted environment) . The main function returns an int value, a typical example of which is almost all programs except the kernel. The corresponding independent environment ( f£reestandingenvironment) does not exist in a standard library, and the program entry is not necessarily main. The most obvious example is the operating system kernel in the operating system kernel. For details, please refer to the latest information on the gcc website) .
