# ::tok The report believes that the content ecology of the e-commerce industry is a comprehensive concept, which integrates e-commerce with content, but not all content can be integrated with e-commerce. Good PGC ( professional production content) and UGC ( user original content) are the high-quality carriers for integration with e-commerce. The higher the value of the content platform, the richer the consumption and promotion scenarios, the higher the possibility of e-commerce implantation, and the stronger the commercial value. The proportion of e-commerce content production and content consumption gradually integrated and distributed in the public and private spheres will also be higher.
