# ::tok MGTO organized a large-scale Hong Kong delegation of more than 100 people composed of representatives from the tourism department of the Hong Kong government, the tourism industry and the media to Macao. In addition to working meetings and industry negotiations, representatives from the Hong Kong travel agency industry and the media also visited a number of tourist attractions, hotels and tourism-related facilities in Macao in batches to introduce the latest Macao tourism products to the Hong Kong market. At the same time, they promoted cultural and tourism links between the two places and jointly expanded the "online travel" market in Hong Kong and Macao. The "online travel" market in Hong Kong and Macao is jointly developed.
