# ::tok It is said to be cowhide, and it is indeed relatively hard, but if you look closely, there are many small cracks in the local area, and it is not clear whether it is genuine leather. In addition, the sleeves of this dress are really incomprehensible. Usually the sleeves of the jacket are longer than the clothes. Some, but usually only 1-2 cm. This dress is 5 cm long, and the arms should naturally droop at the palm of the hand, but the sleeves of this dress cover the fingers.
