# ::tok I think this collection of novels, as well as its title, is like a kind of performance art. What the author wants to express is that love is not only the joys and sorrows on the stage, the sea is dry and the rocks are rotten in urban legends, and it is not just the glue of you and me. Love is not only the above nor should it be represented by the above. Love is also a plain life like water, boring day after day, but also the helplessness of life, the escape of reality, and the loss of the future at a loss.
